{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"Here is the <scxml> state machine you asked for:\n\n```xml\n<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"a\">\n  <state id=\"a\"><transition event=\"go\" target=\"b\"/></state>\n  <final id=\"b\"/>\n</scxml>\n```\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/xml001-chat-prose-with-scxml-tag.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xml001-chat-prose-with-scxml-tag.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":57,"byteOffset":0,"endColumn":1,"endLine":4,"startColumn":1,"startLine":1},"insertedContent":{"text":""}},{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":5,"byteOffset":240,"endColumn":1,"endLine":9,"startColumn":9,"startLine":7},"insertedContent":{"text":"\n"}}]}],"description":{"text":"keep only the SCXML document"},"properties":{"applicability":"machine-applicable"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xml001-chat-prose-with-scxml-tag.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":49,"endLine":1,"startColumn":1,"startLine":1}}}],"message":{"markdown":"chat text and Markdown fences around the SCXML document\n\n**Note:** an SCXML file contains exactly one XML document; the `<scxml>` in the surrounding text is prose, but the parser reads it as the root element, so the real document is nested inside it and never closed\n\n**Help:** save only the XML document: remove everything before `<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" …>` and after its `</scxml>`\n\n**Spec:** XML 1.0 (Fifth Edition) §2.1 Well-Formed XML Documents","text":"chat text and Markdown fences around the SCXML document"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":48,"start":0},"category":"syntax"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"the SCXML document starts here"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xml001-chat-prose-with-scxml-tag.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":7,"endLine":4,"startColumn":2,"startLine":4}}},{"id":2,"message":{"text":"also outside the document"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xml001-chat-prose-with-scxml-tag.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":4,"endLine":8,"startColumn":1,"startLine":8}}}],"ruleId":"XML001"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"SCXML is an XML vocabulary; until the document parses, no schema or semantic rule can run"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: fix the XML syntax at the marked position: remove Markdown code fences or prose outside the single root element, keep `<?xml …?>` at the very start, escape `<` as `&lt;` and `&` as `&amp;` in attribute values and text (or use `<![CDATA[ … ]]>` in `<script>`), close or rename mismatched tags, quote attribute values, specify each attribute once, and never write `--` inside a comment.\n\nSpecification: XML 1.0 (Fifth Edition) §2.1 Well-Formed XML Documents\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain XML001` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/xml/#sec-well-formed","id":"XML001","name":"XML001","properties":{"category":"syntax"},"shortDescription":{"text":"the document is not well-formed XML"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}